## Known limitations / explicitly out of scope

- organization.settings.read/manage and notification.operations.manage
  are catalogued but not yet consumed by any route: no organization-
  settings or notification-operations controller endpoints exist in
  the current accepted base for them to gate. Wiring them in belongs
  to whichever task introduces those endpoints.
- No mapping from Task 0010's (unmerged) OrganizationType to a
  suggested role preset is implemented or hinted at in code, since
  OrganizationType does not exist on this base; the natural integration
  point once 0010 merges is documented here for whoever picks it up,
  not implemented speculatively.
- Task 0018's broader immediate staff-session-revocation system is
  deliberately not touched or absorbed; this task confirms the existing
  revocation model is already correct and adds nothing that would
  weaken it.
- Does not touch 0004-0011 or any other parked/other-lane patch --
  confirmed absent from this branch.
